WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-US

00:00:02.291 --> 00:00:04.730
Hey guys! 
Are you ready to dance like a toy&nbsp;robot?

00:00:05.008 --> 00:00:07.475
Whoa! Alright, let's put it together!

00:00:08.088 --> 00:00:12.334
First start with the body 
and shake it side to side

00:00:12.415 --> 00:00:16.738
Then we put our head on top
and we screw it on tight

00:00:17.053 --> 00:00:21.501
Now we click our arms in place
and we swing them out wide

00:00:21.659 --> 00:00:26.158
Then attach our legs
and they're feeling alright

00:00:26.552 --> 00:00:29.901
Now there's only one thing left to do...

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.240
Press the button and DANCE!

00:00:31.689 --> 00:00:33.138
I'm a robot

00:00:33.961 --> 00:00:36.152
I'm a dancing robot

00:00:36.343 --> 00:00:37.926
I'm a robot

00:00:38.591 --> 00:00:40.194
I'm a dancing robot

00:00:40.351 --> 00:00:44.334
I can feel the music in my bolts and gears

00:00:45.428 --> 00:00:49.744
I'm a robot
and I love to dance, dance, dance

00:00:50.052 --> 00:00:52.654
Oh, we're out of battery! 
Gotta recharge!

00:00:52.769 --> 00:00:56.773
Charge&nbsp;up with your right arm, 
spin it round and round.

00:00:57.413 --> 00:01:01.249
Then charge with your left arm,
spin it round and round

00:01:02.016 --> 00:01:06.020
Now touch your toes,
going up and down

00:01:06.646 --> 00:01:10.984
Then we get wound up
by spinning round and round

00:01:11.477 --> 00:01:14.973
Now there's only one thing left to do...

00:01:15.027 --> 00:01:16.442
Press the button and DANCE!

00:01:16.669 --> 00:01:18.872
I'm a robot

00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:21.320
I'm a dancing robot

00:01:21.365 --> 00:01:23.033
I'm a robot

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:25.212
I'm a dancing robot

00:01:25.402 --> 00:01:29.273
I can feel the music in my bolts and gears

00:01:30.436 --> 00:01:34.442
I'm a robot
and I love to dance, dance, dance

00:01:34.442 --> 00:01:36.504
Oh, we're out of battery again!

00:01:36.504 --> 00:01:38.506
But I see some&nbsp;supercharged batteries!

00:01:39.013 --> 00:01:41.014
Let's grab one and get powered up!

00:01:41.689 --> 00:01:42.690
Ah, there we go!

00:01:43.053 --> 00:01:44.991
There's another one!
Go&nbsp;on, grab it!

00:01:46.583 --> 00:01:47.564
Oh! Another one!

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:50.021
There's another one!

00:01:52.023 --> 00:01:53.024
There we go!

00:01:55.683 --> 00:01:57.089
Now we're really charged up!

00:01:58.332 --> 00:01:59.332
SPEED DANCE!

00:02:08.558 --> 00:02:10.598
I'm a robot

00:02:10.598 --> 00:02:12.815
I'm a dancing robot

00:02:12.815 --> 00:02:15.008
I'm a robot

00:02:15.008 --> 00:02:16.525
I'm a dancing robot

00:02:16.525 --> 00:02:20.528
I can feel the music in my bolts and gears

00:02:21.312 --> 00:02:24.995
I'm a robot
and I love to dance, dance, dance

00:02:26.481 --> 00:02:27.481
Hey, don't forget to subscribe!

